{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Elixr 是一款具備吸收科學原理的補充品追蹤器，能自動標記相互抵消功效的組合並提供研究來源。適合注重營養攝取效率、希望精確管理每日補充劑時間與互動關係的使用者，現正限時免費下載。</p>\n\n<h2>內建科學依據的智能提醒</h2>\n<p>Elixr 整合十五組經研究證實的交互作用數據，點擊即可查看 PubMed 文獻支援。它能根據空腹或進食等條件檢查時間表安排，並在主畫面小工具顯示待辦事項。支援 iCloud 跨裝置同步且無訂閱制，介面簡潔無廣告干擾，透過語音輔助功能確保所有使用者均能順暢操作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-82-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-83-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-84-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-85-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-86-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-87-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Elixr – Supplement Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T18:19:11.384041+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":303,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}